    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92194" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῤάρος</span></b> , ὁ, a word
		found only in Gramm., expid. as =
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαστηρ</span> in <i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			702.37
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Suid.
		</span></i>; as 
			Aeol.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμβρυον</span> in
			Sch.D.T.<i><span class="en">
			p.143
		</span></i> H.; as <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμβλωθρίδιον βρέφος</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lex. de Spir.</u>
				p.215
			</span></i> Valck.; as 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχυρός</span>
			 (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥωρός</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> [The breathing is smooth, as in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ρ̓ᾶρος</span>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				D.T.
			</span></i> and <u>Lex. de Spir.</u> ll. cc.]</div>
